 Ginshi no Hidama). As the name indicates, her long silver hair really stands out."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The country of Watolna was historically founded by those who made a living as bandits, and perhaps because of that blood relationship, she's talented in battle. To compensate for her small build, she specializes in long objects."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17346"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d474a0c16cc3272f1ea428c4f71ef933888f6946bd0737a6db446dff3000d605.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c98726eb015ff2ffc1ee63a87f1f71577d5b0aafd6bf0e3f8fb479d45f33b47f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"草柳 順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57897","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17347","characterName":"リンクス・イリテモ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17347"},"originalCharacterName":"リンクス・イリテモ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has abundant long hair with a hime cut. Slender but with a full bust, she's the person who best understands the first princess."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Versatile, she's able to skillfully utilize 